    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minesweeper, Reimagined\uff01 Experience original Big Bomb Mode + classic minesweeper gameplay, offering dual logic deduction experiences! Enjoy quirky power-ups and collect various skins/achievements! Try it now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/96211aa54570b324e6a184c37aea6f3b.avif?t=1746585806\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, multiple modes, achievement collection \u2013 a brand-new minesweeper with endless challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two distinct gameplay styles, each with dozens of difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative Big Bomb Mode: Reverse logic \u2013 detonate all mines this time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse power-ups: New players can use items to conquer challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable skins: Collect and mix mine markers, flags, tiles and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced trials: Complete badge challenges like no-retry runs, item-free clears, blind sweeps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn coins by clearing stages to buy skins or revive in-game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extreme challenges, historical records, personal achievements await!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minesweeper, Reimagined\uff01 Experience original Big Bomb Mode + classic minesweeper gameplay, offering dual logic deduction experiences! Enjoy quirky power-ups and collect various skins/achievements! Try it now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/96211aa54570b324e6a184c37aea6f3b.avif?t=1746585806\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, multiple modes, achievement collection \u2013 a brand-new minesweeper with endless challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two distinct gameplay styles, each with dozens of difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative Big Bomb Mode: Reverse logic \u2013 detonate all mines this time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse power-ups: New players can use items to conquer challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable skins: Collect and mix mine markers, flags, tiles and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced trials: Complete badge challenges like no-retry runs, item-free clears, blind sweeps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn coins by clearing stages to buy skins or revive in-game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extreme challenges, historical records, personal achievements await!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Minesweeper, Reimagined\uff01Big Bomb Mode meets classic gameplay\u2014master \u200b\u200btwo opposing logic strategies\u200b\u200b in one game\uff01Unlock \u200b\u200bquirky power-ups\u200b\u200b, collect \u200b\u200bflashy skins\u200b\u200b, and earn badges.\u200b\u200bTry now\uff01",
